# Build-context excludes for the images built FROM THE REPO ROOT — every plugin
# broker (`make build-plugins`: `podman build -f plugins/<id>/broker/Dockerfile .`).
# Their Dockerfiles `COPY plugins/<id>/broker/ ./` wholesale, so a developer's
# gitignored sandbox credential would otherwise be baked into an image layer.
# Nothing at runtime reads these files: broker credentials are the
# orchestrator-pushed per-scope map, and only the in-sidecar `spike.js` debug
# helper reads a `.env.local` — from the live container, not the image.
.env
.env.*
**/.env
**/.env.local
plugins/*/broker/.env.local
